title: The Weimar Party System
subtitle: Parties take actions
view-if: (year >= 1935 or (year >= 1934 and month >= 4)) and (time >= next_party_time)
#tags: event
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! 

Q.next_party_time = (Q.time + (Math.floor(Math.random() * 6) + 1) + (Math.floor(Math.random() * 6) + 1));

!}
max-choices: 1

= 魏玛政党体系

德国有许多政党,每一个都是政治舞台上的活跃参与者,致力于推进其主要支持者与意识形态倡导者的利益。为此,它们继续主动作出决策。

- @kpd: The Communist Party of Germany.
- @sapd: The Socialist Workers' Party of Germany.
- @ddp: The [? if ddp_name == "DDP" : German Democratic Party. ?][? if ddp_name == "DStP" : German State Party. ?][? if ddp_name == "RDP" : Radical Democratic Party. ?]
- @z: The Center Party.
- @zca: The Center Christian Alliance.
- @dvp: The German People's Party.
- @dnvp: The German National People's Party.
- @nsdap: The National Socialist German Workers' Party.

@kpd
subtitle: Revolutionary Marxist-Leninists dedicated to the overthrow of capitalism through force of arms.
max-choices: 1

[? if kpd_r >= 20 : 共产党是德国政治中的主导政党,其决策影响举足轻重 —— 尤其是与它历史上作为边缘政党、屡遭迫害的处境相比。 ?]

[? if kpd_r >= 10 and kpd_r < 20 : 共产党是德国政治中的一支重要力量。无论从哪方面说它都算不上主导政党,但它有自己的影响力,并且运用得宜。 ?]

[? if kpd_r >= 5 and kpd_r < 10 : 共产党的处境不佳,但绝非奄奄一息。它仍保有基础与组织机器,打算并希望最终东山再起,克服反动派设下的一切障碍。 ?]

[? if kpd_r < 5 : 共产党已陷入衰败,面临无足轻重、一贫如洗的可能。它会竭力抗拒这一命运。 ?]

- @kpd_workers: The Communists campaign amongst the workers.
- @kpd_unemployed: The Communists campaign amongst the unemployed.
- @kpd_third_period: The Communists rally against Social Democracy.
- @kpd_united_left: The Communists rally for the united front.
- @kpd_relations: The Communists seek to improve our relationship.
- @kpd_policy: The Communists seek to implement policy through their ministries.
- @rfb: The Communists funnel funds to the RFB.
- @sabotage: The Communists engage in industrial sabotage.
- @insurrection: The Communists engage in insurrectionary activity.

@kpd_workers
frequency: 200
view-if: not kpd_banned
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(socialism/100); workers_spd -= 3*(left_dissent/100); workers_kpd += 2*(left_dissent/100) if not sapd_consolidated

共产党人在工人中展开宣传,力求在他们眼中至关重要的人群中提升支持。

@kpd_unemployed
frequency: 200
view-if: not kpd_banned
on-arrival: unemployed_kpd += 9*(socialism/100); unemployed_nsdap -= 5*(1-bourgeois_power); unemployed_nsdap -= 3*(socialism/100);

共产党人在失业者中开展宣传 —— 由于处境极度不稳、被资本主义剥夺了权力,这些人更容易走向激进化。

@kpd_third_period
frequency: 100
view-if: (third_period or year <= 1935) and kpd_relation < 50 and not kpd_banned
on-arrival:  workers_spd -= 4*(left_dissent/100); workers_kpd += 3*(left_dissent/100); unemployed_spd -= 6*(left_dissent/100); unemployed_kpd += 6*(left_dissent/100); workers_kpd -= 3*(left_strength/100); unemployed_kpd -= 6*(left_strength/100); kpd_relation -= 5; socialism -= 1

共产党人打着他们「第三时期」的口号开展宣传,抨击社会民主是法西斯的左翼,并号召工人拒绝我们。

@kpd_united_left
frequency: 100
view-if: kpd_relation >= 65 and left_strength > reformist_strength and not third_period and not kpd_banned
on-arrival: socialism += (kpd_relation/100); workers_kpd += 5*(socialism/100); workers_spd -= 2*(left_dissent/100); unemployed_kpd += 5*(socialism/100); unemployed_spd -= 3*(left_dissent/100)

共产党人为统一战线而集会,与我们的组织并肩协作,投身工人日常的斗争。

@kpd_relations
frequency: 50
view-if: ((kpd_party_leader == "Conciliators" or kpd_relation >= (100-nsdap_votes-left_strength)) and left_strength > left_dissent) and kpd_relation < socialism
on-arrival: kpd_relation += 3; left_strength += 6

共产党人主动接触我们,寻求建立更广泛的社会主义阵线、展开协作,弥合彼此的分歧。

@rfb
frequency: 50
view-if: not rfb_banned or communist_coalition < 3
on-arrival: rfb_strength += kpd_votes; rfb_militancy += ((kpd_votes/1000)+0.02)

共产党人向 RFB 输送资金,帮它武装、装备起来,以备最终的革命对决。

@sabotage
frequency: 25
view-if: kpd_banned or (kpd_votes >= kpd_relation+socialism and kpd_votes < (economic_growth*2))
on-arrival: workers_kpd -= economic_growth if economic_growth > 0; economic_growth -= (workers_kpd_normalized/100)

共产党人投身破坏活动,试图通过非法罢工及其他更直接的破坏手段拖慢经济。这使他们与更广大的工人群众隔绝开来。

@insurrection
frequency: 150
view-if: (chancellor_party == "NSDAP" or chancellor_party == "DNVP" or (third_period and kpd_relation < 0 and in_emergency_government) or kpd_banned) and rfb_force >= 1
on-arrival: strife += 1; rfb_militancy += 0.05; rfb_strength -= (sa_strength/100)*(sa_militancy); sa_strength -= (rfb_strength/100)*(rfb_militancy); reichswehr_militancy -= (rfb_militancy*rfb_militancy); workers_kpd -= 6*(pro_republic/100)

共产党人从事暴动活动,迫使 RFB 加剧街头战斗与暴动级别的行动。

@sapd
subtitle: Centrist Marxists dedicated to the building of a united proletarian front to lead the rupture with capital.
view-if: sapd_formed
max-choices: 1

[? if not sapd_consolidated : 社会主义工人党与其说是一个独立的真正政党,不如说仍是个压力团体 —— 不过若我们不慎,它可能通过整合而改变这一点。 ?]

[? if sapd_consolidated : 社会主义工人党已成长为一个自己的大党;若我们不能为工人兑现承诺,它就会不断威胁着要从我们的左翼拉走支持者。 ?]

- @sapd_workers: The Socialists campaign amongst the workers.
- @sapd_unemployed: The Socialists campaign amongst the unemployed.
- @sapd_new_middle: The Socialists campaign amongst the new middle class.
- @sapd_rural: The Socialists campaign amongst the farmers. 
- @sapd_united_frontism: The Socialists work towards a united front.
- @sapd_centrists: 社会主义者试图吸引中间派。
- @sapd_labor: The Socialists attempt to win over the trade unions.

@sapd_workers
frequency: 200
on-arrival: workers_sapd += 3*(socialism/100); workers_sapd += 3*(socialism/100) if sapd_consolidated; workers_kpd -= 3*(pro_republic/100) if third_period and kpd_relation < left_strength and sapd_consolidated; workers_spd -= 3*(unemployed/100) if (spd_in_government or spd_toleration) and sapd_consolidated

社会主义工人党在工人中开展宣传,力图把自己确立为在德国建设社会主义的「正确」社会主义政党 —— 以区别于我们这些怯懦的社会民主党人与固执的共产党人。

@sapd_unemployed
frequency: 100
on-arrival: unemployed_sapd += 1*(socialism/50); unemployed_sapd += 3*(socialism/100) if sapd_consolidated; unemployed_sapd += 3*(1-(unemployed_sapd_normalized/100)) if sapd_consolidated; unemployed_kpd -= 2*(pro_republic/100) if third_period and kpd_relation < left_strength and sapd_consolidated; unemployed_spd -= 3*(unemployed/100) if (spd_in_government or spd_toleration) and sapd_consolidated
view-if: unemployed >= 10

社会主义工人党在失业者中开展宣传,试图打破共产党人在这一人群中传统的支配地位,转而支持它对社会主义的构想。

@sapd_new_middle
frequency: 50
view-if: new_middle_conscious or socialism >= 55 or peoples_party
on-arrival: new_middle_sapd += 2*(socialism/100)*(1-bourgeois_power); new_middle_spd += 4*(socialism/100)*(1-bourgeois_power) if sapd_consolidated

社会主义工人党在新中间阶层中开展宣传,试图把白领工人引向它对社会主义的构想,但成效有限。

@sapd_rural
frequency: 25
view-if: land_reform >= 3 
on-arrival: rural_sapd += land_reform*(socialism/200)*(1-bourgeois_power); rural_sapd += land_reform*(socialism/100)*(1-bourgeois_power) if sapd_consolidated

社会主义工人党在德国乡间开展宣传,试图让乡村劳动者与城市同伴联合起来,但成效有限。

@sapd_united_frontism
frequency: 100
view-if: kpd_relation < socialism
on-arrival: kpd_relation += (socialism/100); left_strength += (socialism/100)

社会主义工人党为统一战线展开宣传,力图在我党与共产党内部都壮大支持这一主张的力量。

@sapd_centrists
frequency: 150
view-if: not centrists_resigned
on-arrival: center_dissent += (1+sapd_votes)

社会主义工人党试图说服社民党中的中间派组织者倒戈,带着他们的本领过来,帮助该党成为一支更强大、更宏大的力量。

@sapd_labor
frequency: 150
view-if: not unions_independent
on-arrival: labor_dissent += (1+sapd_votes)

社会主义工人党试图说服社民党中的工会倒戈,带着他们组织起来的工人过来,帮助该党成为一支更强大、更宏大的力量。

@ddp
subtitle: Liberals of a more republican and left-wing orientation.
max-choices: 1
view-if: not ddp_banned

[? if ddp_r >= 10 : [+ ddp_name +] 取得了出人意料的成功,绽放为一个有能力的大众政党。 ?]

[? if ddp_r >= 5 and ddp_r < 10 : [+ ddp_name +] 已成一个虽小却仍有分量的政党,时而能在关键表决中左右票数、为重大政策争取或动员支持。不过,它的重要性已经下降,必须奋力挣扎才能避免衰亡。 ?]

[? if ddp_r < 5 : [+ ddp_name +] 近来表现不佳,面对着日益加剧的两极分化与激进化。或许有一天,它能从濒死状态中挣扎着爬回来。 ?]

- @ddp_workers: The Democrats campaign amongst the workers.
- @ddp_new_middle: The Democrats campaign amongst the new middle class.
- @ddp_old_middle: The Democrats campaign amongst the old middle class.
- @ddp_rural: The Democrats campaign in the countryside.
- @ddp_democracy: The Democrats rally for democracy.
#- @ddp_policy: The Democrats implement their policy agendas.

@ddp_workers
frequency: 50
view-if: ((socialism/100) < bourgeois_power) or ddp_socialist
on-arrival: workers_ddp += 3*bourgeois_power*(1-(socialism/100)); workers_ddp += 3*bourgeois_power*(ddp_relation/100); workers_spd -= 3*(left_strength/100)*(1-(socialism/100))*bourgeois_power; workers_ddp += 1 if ddp_name == "RDP"

民主党人加强在工人中的宣传,试图打破社会主义在工人阶级中的支配地位。

@ddp_new_middle
frequency: 200
on-arrival: new_middle_ddp += 6*(pro_republic/100)*bourgeois_power; new_middle_spd -= 3*(1-(socialism/100)) if not new_middle_conscious; new_middle_nsdap -= 3*(pro_republic/100)*(1-(nationalism/100)); new_middle_ddp += 1 if ddp_name == "DDP"

民主党人在新中间阶层中开展宣传,作为自由主义的捍卫者,巩固他们在白领专业人士中的支持。

@ddp_old_middle
frequency: 100
view-if: nationalism < pro_republic
on-arrival: old_middle_ddp += 3*(pro_republic/100)*(1-(nationalism/100)); old_middle_ddp += 1 if ddp_name == "DStP"

民主党人在旧中间阶层中开展宣传,意图在这个共和国走向稳定的时期,连那些往往反动的店主阶层也引向左翼自由主义。

@ddp_rural
view-if: land_reform 
frequency: 50
on-arrival: rural_ddp += land_reform*bourgeois_power; rural_nsdap -= land_reform*(pro_republic/100); rural_dnvp -= land_reform*(pro_republic/100)*(1-(nationalism/100))

民主党人在乡间开展宣传,鉴于土地改革计划使农民渐渐倾向进步,试图建立一支农业翼。

@ddp_democracy
view-if: pro_republic < nationalism
frequency: 100
on-arrival: nationalism -= ddp_votes*(1-(pro_republic/100)); pro_republic += ddp_votes*(1-(unemployed/100))

民主党人为共和国而集会,反对右翼反动的民族主义;但受自身规模与共和国整体声望所限,他们的作为有其限度。

@z
subtitle: Catholics.
max-choices: 1
view-if: not z_banned and not zca_formed

天主教中央党为教会、也为德国全体天主教徒的权利而斗争。

- @catholics: The Center Party consolidates Catholics.

@catholics
on-arrival: catholics_z += 5; catholics_other -= 5

中央党代表德国的天主教徒,并在他们之中巩固自己的基础。

@zca
subtitle: The mass party of the whole bourgeoisie united against an ascendant socialism.
max-choices: 1
view-if: zca_formed

中央基督教联盟自成立以来,便对社会主义施政构成重大而称职的威胁,为恢复自由民主而不遗余力地斗争 —— 这种自由民主,曾是我们不遗余力地加以捍卫、以免落入妄图复辟反动专制者之手的东西,而如今却成了为历史继续前进而被弃置的东西。

@dvp
subtitle: Liberals of a more nationalistic and right-wing orientation, chained to industrialist interests.
max-choices: 1
view-if: not dvp_banned and not zca_formed

[? if dvp_r >= 10 : 人民党取得了出人意料的成功,绽放为一个有能力的大众政党。 ?]

[? if dvp_r < 10 and dvp_r >= 5 : 人民党已成一个虽小却仍有分量的政党,时而能在关键表决中左右票数、为重大政策争取或动员支持。不过,它的重要性已经下降,必须奋力挣扎才能避免衰亡。 ?]

[? if dvp_r < 5 : 人民党近来表现不佳,面对着日益加剧的两极分化与激进化。或许有一天,它能从濒死状态中挣扎着爬回来。 ?]

@dnvp
subtitle: Virulent reactionaries and antisemites dedicated to the restoration of Imperial Germany.
max-choices: 1
view-if: not dnvp_banned

[? if dnvp_r >= 20 : 国家人民党是德国政治中的关键角色,代表其所代表的贵族与资产阶级利益,以举足轻重之势影响决策。我们必须尽全力对抗这种影响,否则就会看到德国重归帝制统治。 ?]

[? if dnvp_r >= 10 and dnvp_r < 20 : 国家人民党是德国政治中的一支重要力量。它目前并非主导政党,却因其代表的利益而拥有超乎比例的影响力 —— 我们将尽全力加以对抗。 ?]

[? if dnvp_r >= 5 and dnvp_r < 10 : 国家人民党的处境不佳,但绝非奄奄一息。它仍保有追随者与支持,希望有朝一日借此东山再起、重申帝国的权威。 ?]

[? if dnvp_r < 5 : 国家人民党已归于默默无闻;随着对旧时代的怀恋在新的繁荣之下萎谢,它那狭窄利益集团支持的本质终于让它自食其果。 ?]

- @dnvp_workers: The DNVP campaigns amongst workers.
- @dnvp_middle: The DNVP campaigns amongst the middle class.
- @dnvp_rural: The DNVP campaigns in the countryside.
- @dnvp_nationalism: 国家人民党为民族主义拉拢支持。
- @dnvp_antirepublic: The DNVP rallies against the republic.
- @hugenberg: Hugenberg commits the DNVP to *Katastrophenpolitik*.
- @moderation: The DNVP tries to break from its reputation as an unworkable party.

@dnvp_workers
view-if: dnvp_reform or ((workers_spd_normalized+workers_kpd_normalized+workers_sapd_normalized) >= nationalism)
frequency: 50
on-arrival: workers_dnvp += 4*bourgeois_power*(nationalism/100)*(1-(pro_republic/100))*(1-(socialism/100))

国家人民党试图打破有组织劳工对工人阶级的掌控,把我们的基础驱向他们的民族主义意识形态。所幸,他们不太可能取得多少成功。

@dnvp_middle
frequency: 200
on-arrival: new_middle_dnvp += 6*bourgeois_power*(nationalism/100)*(1-(pro_republic/100)); old_middle_dnvp += 6*bourgeois_power*(nationalism/50)*(1-(pro_republic/100))

国家人民党在中间阶层中开展宣传,主要是旧中间阶层,也包括新中间阶层中最反动的那一层。

@dnvp_rural
frequency: 250
on-arrival: rural_dnvp += 6*bourgeois_power*(nationalism/(50+(land_reform*20)))*(1-(pro_republic/100))

国家人民党在其传统的堡垒 —— 乡间开展宣传。

@dnvp_nationalism
frequency: 100
on-arrival: nationalism += 15*dnvp_normalized*(1-(nationalism/100))

国家人民党为德国民族主义与例外论展开宣传,试图为其军国主义事业重新注入支持。

@dnvp_antirepublic
frequency: 100
on-arrival: pro_republic -= 15*dnvp_normalized*(pro_republic/100)

国家人民党抨击共和国及其制度,试图鼓动人们支持威权统治 —— 具体而言即帝制复辟 —— 作为一种替代性的方案与治理模式。

@hugenberg
frequency: 50
view-if: not dnvp_reform
on-arrival: z_relation += dnvp_r/3; dvp_relation += dnvp_r/6; nationalism += dnvp_votes*(1-(pro_republic/100)); pro_republic -= dnvp_votes*(unemployed/100); {!

Q.workers_dnvp -= Q.pro_republic/10;
Q.workers_dnvp += Q.nationalism/20;

Q.new_middle_dnvp -= Q.pro_republic/10;
Q.new_middle_dnvp += Q.nationalism/20;

Q.old_middle_dnvp -= Q.pro_republic/10;
Q.old_middle_dnvp += Q.nationalism/20;

Q.rural_dnvp -= Q.pro_republic/10;
Q.rural_dnvp += Q.nationalism/20;

Q.coup_progress += Q.sh_force/10;

!}

国家人民党在胡根贝格领导下毫不妥协的路线,通过排除法把其他资产阶级政党推向我们,同时也有可能使该党与更广大的群众隔绝。

@moderation
frequency: 50
view-if: dnvp_reform
on-arrival: z_relation -= dnvp_r/6; dvp_relation -= dnvp_r/3

国家人民党宣布自己是一个建设性政党,愿意与其他资产阶级政党合作。

@nsdap
subtitle: Fascists seeking the imposition of their will upon the whole European continent through violent dictatorship, conquest, and war.
max-choices: 1

纳粹是一场危险的、甚至是所有势力中最危险的运动。他们是法西斯主义在德国的变体,始终尖锐而持续地威胁着民主 —— 即便在相对稳定的时期也不例外。

